Package: dsh
Version: 1.7.5
Architecture: amd64
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Maintainer: SurpassHither <surpasshither@outlook.com>
Depends: systemd, libc6 (>= 2.35), python3
Description: DSH for TOS
 An unofficial TerraMaster packaging of DeepSeek Harness (DSH), the open-source
 coding-agent web UI published by DeepSeek under the MIT license. A fixed Node.js
 runtime is bundled so the app works offline after installation.
